# What comes next

The 22 → 10 selection and the twenty independent checks of those ten are complete within their recorded scope. The AI coordinator recommends E050, E009 and E012, with E078 and E041 in reserve. [Five short cards in Russian](reading/20261031/FIVE_CARDS_RU.md) replace an obligation to read all ten.

1. Prepare recorded AI revisions addressing the new close predecessors and the precise scope of the selected arguments. Preserve every frozen version; independently check changed substantive claims.
2. Prepare anonymous manuscripts and the methodology report. Check word counts, citations, file properties and the actual submission fields against current rules.
3. Confirm the custodian's submission account and final package. Submit only on an explicit instruction.

There is no fixed calendar or prescribed division into chats. Completed campaigns remain closed. Original essays, rejected candidates, disagreements, and retained logs stay available. The recommendation is not a novelty certificate or submission approval. Public release remains a separate decision under the [publication policy](PUBLICATION.md).
